From 3d2037301117f02c0d76ca79427b0066d2d763e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:16:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Narrow exact dashboard bookkeeping reads and reuse
 episode payloads

Card E stage7: retain unmarked wide task rows after typed bookkeeping comparison, avoid dispatch-priority traversal for ID fetches, use correlated heartbeat marks and covering tuple run inventories, and reuse pure episode payload decoding. Clock/config/replica projection remains live. No acceptance or polling changes.

Proof: seven regression failures on parent code; 202 broader consumer tests and 42 final-head focused tests green. scripts/check all20 green. Scale FAIL: pinned-WAL changed-list GET grows 5.347ms to8.057ms (1.5068262577x > unchanged1.5x); other nine steady-state scale gates pass. Harness exit0 was not acceptance: its report exposes the failure. Live <=0.8% remains unmet; prior stage6 1.121438406% remains authoritative. This PR is an unlanded candidate awaiting owning-card failure disposition, exact-head independent review and CI.
